BEHAVIOR build-request

DESCRIPTION
  Builds a minimal HTTP/1.0 POST request from a body.
  Prefix is "POST / HTTP/1.0\r\n\r\n" (19 bytes), then the body bytes.
  Outputs the full request bytes and its total length.

CONTRACT
  INPUT body bytes 65536
  INPUT body_len int 8
  OUTPUT request bytes 65536
  OUTPUT req_len int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 44dce179

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE request 80 1 0
  STORE request 79 1 1
  STORE request 83 1 2
  STORE request 84 1 3
  STORE request 32 1 4
  STORE request 47 1 5
  STORE request 32 1 6
  STORE request 72 1 7
  STORE request 84 1 8
  STORE request 84 1 9
  STORE request 80 1 10
  STORE request 47 1 11
  STORE request 49 1 12
  STORE request 46 1 13
  STORE request 48 1 14
  STORE request 13 1 15
  STORE request 10 1 16
  STORE request 13 1 17
  STORE request 10 1 18

  blen = LOAD body_len 8
  counter = ALLOC 8 int
  STORE counter 0 8
  JUMP loop_check

  LABEL loop_check
  i = LOAD counter 8
  cond = ILT i blen 8
  BRANCH cond loop_body loop_end

  LABEL loop_body
  b = LOAD body 1 i
  dst = IADD i 19 8
  STORE request b 1 dst
  next = IADD i 1 8
  STORE counter next 8
  JUMP loop_check

  LABEL loop_end
  total = IADD blen 19 8
  STORE req_len total 8
  FREE counter
END
